# Where the release directories and collector output live on the host.
#
# Defaults (used when unset) are /srv/www and /srv/status-data, which is where
# these belong alongside the other services. Override only while running out of a
# home directory — /srv is root-owned and creating it needs sudo.
#
# WWW_ROOT=/home/jiztom/srv/www
# STATUS_DATA_ROOT=/home/jiztom/srv/status-data
